                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "905bc762-ec78-3fb6-8a0e-536ec4446826",
                        "entry_id": "6a95de6f-a4df-3eaf-8347-40fa5305475b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "устар., авиац. то же, что вертолёт; летательный аппарат тяжелее воздуха, поднимающийся в воздух вертикально при помощи воздушного винта на вертикальной оси"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "782e8572-3358-4338-8f6c-1b0e4d0dbb36",
                                "sense_id": "905bc762-ec78-3fb6-8a0e-536ec4446826",
                                "text": "Наконец, в настоящем большом геликоптере, который был построен мною в 1910 году, с мотором в 25 лош. сил, на каждую лошадиную силу удалось получить лишь около 18 фунтов подъёмной силы."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "14578f2b-59cb-4df6-bdbf-98c6ff59a86b",
                                "sense_id": "905bc762-ec78-3fb6-8a0e-536ec4446826",
                                "text": "И, конечно, это превосходно, что такое обрусение слов происходит и в наши дни, что аэроплан заменился у нас самолётом, геликоптер — вертолётом, грузовой автомобиль — грузовиком, митральеза — пулемётом, думпкар — самосвалом…"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1ad485d7-426a-42d5-876e-41d75dec377d",
                        "source_entry_id": "6a95de6f-a4df-3eaf-8347-40fa5305475b",
                        "source_sense_id": "905bc762-ec78-3fb6-8a0e-536ec4446826",
                        "target_lang_word": "helicopter",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "helicopter",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5d0a59ee-3f29-34ad-9523-a4e27f62066a",
                                        "entry_id": "e31711c7-434f-3fae-866f-2e57a15f2332",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An aircraft that is borne along by one or more sets of long rotating blades which allow it to hover, move in any direction including reverse, or land; and typically having a smaller set of blades on its tail to stabilize the aircraft."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "26646339-3bca-4506-9270-6327216fd6ff",
                                                "sense_id": "5d0a59ee-3f29-34ad-9523-a4e27f62066a",
                                                "text": "We flew over the city in a helicopter."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "af939839-4fa2-4f99-b40a-ca2561f1faad",
                                                "sense_id": "5d0a59ee-3f29-34ad-9523-a4e27f62066a",
                                                "text": "I’ve flown in flimsy microlights, soaring serenely above rich farmland. I’ve ridden tactical combat helicopters missions, skimming the desert floor and banking hard around sand dunes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6b74707d-1f64-4eea-9a33-9fc348310ab9",
                                                "sense_id": "5d0a59ee-3f29-34ad-9523-a4e27f62066a",
                                                "text": "Investigators trying to determine what caused last week’s deadly midair collision between a US military Black Hawk helicopter and an American Airlines plane near Washington, DC, briefed lawmakers Thursday on what they’ve learned after combing through data from both aircraft and air traffic control."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4562e607-29f4-32bb-ae01-ef26a5a21c61",
                                        "entry_id": "e31711c7-434f-3fae-866f-2e57a15f2332",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A powered troweling machine with spinning blades used to spread concrete."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1023f18b-846b-3ac7-9ef6-40a8265e04ad",
                                        "entry_id": "e31711c7-434f-3fae-866f-2e57a15f2332",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The winged fruit of certain trees, such as ash, elm, and maple."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c0b0057d-b9e7-320a-976d-29bfef7a8ba5",
                                        "entry_id": "e31711c7-434f-3fae-866f-2e57a15f2332",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A dragonfly; so named due to its resemblance to a helicopter (sense 1)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fdf3068e-8fe0-3f7f-8c09-dfc78e803602",
                                        "entry_id": "e31711c7-434f-3fae-866f-2e57a15f2332",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A whirling trick performed with devil sticks."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5f018096-f080-337f-b924-ace78a28b17f",
                                        "entry_id": "e31711c7-434f-3fae-866f-2e57a15f2332",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A breakdance move in which the dancer spins on the floor while extending the legs to resemble the blades of a helicopter."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
